      "reason": "No faithful claim generated after bounded retries: semantic faithfulness mismatch: intent_resolution_succeeds other_mismatch: The statement is about resolveDispute succeeding and clearing the disputer, but the predicate only asserts tree updates are not blocked.; P/I/V relation other_mismatch: V asserts tree_updates_blocked while I asserts its negation under the same P, so V contradicts I, but I itself does not encode the resolveDispute success claim."
